e category combo can only ever match the default attribute option\ncombo. In that case resolve the default AOC up front and apply it as an\nexplicit filter so the export query skips the per-row AOC data-sharing\ncheck, which otherwise scans the whole categoryoptioncombo table.\n\n- DataExportStore#getDefaultAttributeOptionComboForDataSets resolves the\n  default AOC only when every existing given data set uses the default\n  attribute category combo; returns null otherwise (missing/non-default\n  combo) so the regular per-row check is used.\n- DefaultDataExportService applies it when no explicit attributeOptionCombo\n  / attributeOptions filter is given and the export is data-set-scoped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K1EkU1W5wYfEbRsqX4FcCU","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"85fb754f1b0a70fcd94d50386c52168df9eb3363","tree_id":"a47f81dc6dfa85e2041a2cbb2de7c2ac2d2af5e7","timestamp":"2026-09-07T17:13:50Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use